## THE REGIONS — the tunnels and the keep, and the way back
## ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

create the Tunnels
  a region
  containing the Underneath the Fountain, the Tunnel End

create the Lord's Keep
  a region
  containing the Chapel, the Lower Bailey, the Upper Bailey, the Guardhouse

## `story.ni:7586-7589` — Bobby brings up the rear on the way home.

create the Secret Way
  a region
  containing the Tunnels, the Lord's Keep

  on every turn while the player is in the Secret Way and Bobby is returning and Bobby is not here
    move Bobby here
    phrase bobby-follows
  end on

define phrase bobby-follows, randomly
  Bobby follows you.
or
  Bobby comes along quietly.
or
  Bobby quickly brings up the rear.
or
  Bobby follows right behind you.
end phrase

