create the Lord's Road
  a room
  aka lords road, road, wide road, paved road
  east to the Pasture
  north is blocked: southern-gate-guarded
  northeast is blocked: bobby-went-east

  The wide and well-paved Lord's Road runs from Grubber's Market straight
  north to Lord's Keep, a mile or so from the city. To the east are rolling
  pastures; to the west, broken ground and scrub. {bobby-waiting}

  after the player entering while Bobby is agreed
    phrase bobby-walk-past
    start the player's dawdle
    change Bobby to leading
  end after

