    first time
      move Bobby to the Pasture
      phrase bobby-thumb-down-the-road
      restart the player's dawdle when the player's dawdle has not expired
  end after

define phrase bobby-thumb-down-the-road
  Bobby jerks his thumb down the road, to the north. 'This road leads straight
  to the front gate of Lord's Keep; we want to stay away from there. I know a
  better way,' he says with a knowing smile, and strikes off towards the open
  field to the east.
end phrase

