## ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

create the Stream Crossing
  a room
  aka crossing, stream crossing, north end, northern pasture
  north to the Woods
  southwest to the Lord's Road, one-way
  west is blocked: southern-gate-guarded
  northwest is blocked: no-crossing-that-way
  northeast is blocked: no-crossing-that-way
  east is blocked: endless-farmland
  southeast is blocked: endless-farmland

  A small stream bubbles out of the woods and cuts through the pasture's
  north end. The edge of the forest lies to the north, just across the
  water. The city is far away to the south. {bobby-waiting}

  after the player entering
    first time
      move Bobby to the Clearing
      phrase bobby-hops-across
      restart the player's dawdle when the player's dawdle has not expired
  end after

define phrase bobby-hops-across
  Bobby hops nimbly across, bouncing from rock to rock as though he were
  playing a game of Circles-and-Stones in the park. He doesn't get so much
  as the hem of his cloak damp. When he gets to the opposite bank, he turns
  and beckons you to follow before disappearing into the shadowy woods.
end phrase

define phrase no-crossing-that-way
  There's no place to cross the stream in that direction.
end phrase

