  shin-deep
  in the Stream Crossing

  The water is clean and clear, rippling over a shallow bed of stones and
  splashing over the larger rocks. It's only about ten feet wide here; you
  could probably pick your way across.

  on the player entering
    move the player to the Woods
  end on

  on the player drinking
    refuse water-shockingly-cold
  end on


